 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Harbour. Last car onto the ferry. You roll up the ramp. Then the engines start.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "The ramp is closing. And you're still on it. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: reverse! Back to dry land!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "But the ramp is already too steep. It turns into a ski jump. And you fly. Backwards.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Right over the harbour. Into the fish market. On the ice, between the salmon. Price per kilo: very reasonable.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stay calm. Handbrake on. And honk twice, like a ship: I'm still here!",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "The captain answers with the ship's horn. And the ramp comes back down.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "You roll on board. Slowly. The last car.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "And for the nice honking, he gives you the best seat on the ship: the ramp, open like a balcony. Sea view.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "Then the dolphins come to say hello. Right over your bonnet.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: a car wash the size of a stadium. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
